<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTO-AC MILAN TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTO-AC MILAN TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup Champions' League group D match between Porto of Portugal and AC Milan of Italy:</p>
<p>Porto - 24-Henrique Hilario, 4-Aloisio Alves, 5-Fernando Mendes, 7-Sergio Conceicao, 11-Ljubimko Drulovic, 14-Artur Oliveira, 17-Jose Barroso, 18-Manuel Bino, 21-Edmilson Pimenta, 22-Jorge Costa, 25-Zlatko Zahovic</p>
<p>AC Milan - 1-Sebastiano Rossi, 2-Christian Panucci, 3-Paolo Maldini, 6-Franco Baresi, 8-Marcel Desailly, 11-Alessandro Costacurta, 24-Stefano Eranio, 20-Zvonimir Boban, 22-Edgar Davids, 9-George Weah, 18-Roberto Baggio</p>
